    "text": "For the given compounds, the correct order of increasing \\(\\mathrm{pK}_{\\mathrm{a}}\\) value :\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/SmSvFGddmZFgecmGwc0U4iDYW1A5bxJMGcGLHXkjv7I.original.fullsize.png\"><br />Choose the correct answer from the options given below :",
